OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warning after 'cloned' car
OL,4,Asales double
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are urging people to be vigilant
OL,7,Fafter an increase in cases of cloned
OL,8,Fvehicle fraud.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said they had
OL,11,Fseized at least one cloned vehicle
OL,12,Fevery week last year, more than double
OL,13,Fthe total from 2023.
OL,15,F"Cloned" vehicles are stolen cars that
OL,16,Fcriminals give an identity that matches
OL,17,Fthose of another, genuine vehicle,
OL,18,Fbefore selling them on privately
OL,19,Fthrough online platforms.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
