OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warning after 'cloned' car
OL,4,Asales double
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're seeing false VIN numbers,
OL,7,Freplacement labels and even
OL,8,Freprogrammed electronic systems so that
OL,9,Feverything appears legitimate when
OL,10,Fchecked, in some cases, even the locks
OL,11,Fand keys have been replaced," said Avon
OL,12,Fand Somerset Police's stolen vehicle
OL,13,Fexaminer Matt Neale.
